WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.858
Retrieve a public-access AED safely.

00:00:02.858 --> 00:00:07.542
Do not strike break-glass panels with bare hands or elbows.

00:00:07.542 --> 00:00:16.115
Use an object such as a phone, shoe or keys, then clear fragments from the edge before reaching for the key.
